  "historyNote": "#6328, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96 New. #6468-B, eff 3-5-97; repealed and reserved by #7859, eff 4-11-03 New. #8278, eff 2-4-05 (from Env-A 1404.01); ss by #9601, eff 11-25-09; ss by #12443, eff 1-5-18; ss by #13334, eff 2-3-22 (formerly Env-A 1403.01)",
